        "raw_sha256": "cd257e85379e650861e1247ef79f9d9fb000f717520acc6b7b11607f99e0c87b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 1
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u2",
      "position": 2,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "2.你觉得就是从技术角度以及你个人的角度，你跟这个岗位的匹配性是怎样的 实习过程最大的收获是什么呢？",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_json/68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5.json@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "d66f0df9d9d4f8097a99959bab59cdccb967ed9db2b9a650595f091167be4919",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "cd257e85379e650861e1247ef79f9d9fb000f717520acc6b7b11607f99e0c87b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 2
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u3",
      "position": 3,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "3.像这种互联网的大厂，可能你的工作内容只聚焦在那一个很小的领域，那你觉得就是从长远自身的发展或者是技术能力的提升上来讲，这样的话会不会给你带来一些不好的影响？或者是你未来的话会怎么提升自己的技术能力？",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_json/68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5.json@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "d66f0df9d9d4f8097a99959bab59cdccb967ed9db2b9a650595f091167be4919",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "cd257e85379e650861e1247ef79f9d9fb000f717520acc6b7b11607f99e0c87b",
        "source_projection_item_number": 3
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-11:u4",
      "position": 4,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "4.你未来的话就是比如说工作地点这边你是怎么考虑的呀？",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_json/68d8ab3a000000001301d7a5.json@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
